{ No maxstep given: the default span/100 cap governs, so a problem whose error
  controller wants a much larger step is entirely maxstep-driven. Any
  difference in the default is a visible row-value difference. }
DYNAMIC slow (method = ode45, time = 0 .. 1000, points = 11)
  der(Yv) = -0.0001*Yv
  Yv(0) = 1000
END
